33cb07?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2956ec910d7bef1c64f95053814d8225", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Hi nice to meet you! I hope you could draw my original character. He’s a weak patient. The recommending elements would include white bird/ books/ syringes and blood/anything related to these above.\nThank you so much and please feel free to draw!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-88LLU_-nHAAkygWMzcZ01eybAtzyOEA", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@Shuuho/works/51", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2048871, "client_id": 2090119, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/277db6bf/uploads/origins/06180e81-b8a0-4777-8cb8-3abf3d73d062?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bd9c2b1e384747d89d5e9a7e7713581f", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/277db6bf/uploads/origins/06180e81-b8a0-4777-8cb8-3abf3d73d062?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b88c0ed74b99e0df23658143cb0540c6", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Yomotobi様\n前回は素敵なイラストを描いて頂き、誠にありがとうございました。\n前回描いて頂いたキャラを再度描いて頂きたく思い、依頼に参りました。\n淡い茶色の長髪の男性キャラをお願いします。\n\n今回描いて頂きたいシチュエーション\n・暗い雰囲気\n・可能であれば血\n・苦悩の表情\n\n構図や髪型のアレンジなどお好きに描いて頂けると幸いです。\n金額等難しい場合は遠慮なくキャンセルや再送信してください。\nご検討の程、どうぞよろしくお願い致します。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1rdQ3ORCsfzalRnTVzYd1wT5FYvM9azQo?usp=sharing", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@Shuuho/works/50", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2048871, "client_id": 1377136, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/7ec38411/uploads/origins/a0bd66f6-3859-4cdb-ab0